{
  "$schemaVersion": 1,
  "$comment": "A3（DEEP_REVIEW 0ef3bbe §七）executor-protocol —— admin-api / executor-node / executor-python 三方共享的执行器协议契约向量。单一事实源，语言无关，三端测试套件加载同一份文件断言。此前这些语义只靠两侧注释互相引用（\"见 node execute.ts:xxx parity\"）维持，属于\"注释里的 parity\"——本文件把它变成\"红在 CI\"。规则：向量只能追加、不能修改（已发布端按旧向量断言）；语义变更属破坏性契约变更，须三端同批发布并 bump $schemaVersion。",
  "readiness": {
    "$comment": "就绪探针。判定维度各端按职责不同（admin 看 DB/Redis；执行器看资源 + admin 连通性），但**HTTP 状态码与 payload 形状必须三方一致**——探针与运维脚本不该为三个组件写三套解析。",
    "perComponent": {
      "admin-api": {
        "path": "/api/health/ready",
        "bodyPath": "data",
        "$comment": "admin-api 有全局 ResponseInterceptor（信封 {code,message,data}），readiness payload 落在 data 下；执行器无信封，payload 就是顶层。"
      },
      "executor-node": {
        "path": "/health/ready",
        "bodyPath": ""
      },
      "executor-python": {
        "path": "/health/ready",
        "bodyPath": ""
      }
    },
    "statusValues": ["ready", "not_ready"],
    "ready": {
      "httpStatus": 200
    },
    "notReady": {
      "httpStatus": 503,
      "$comment": "不就绪**必须**返回 503——探针只看 HTTP 码，200 + status:'not_ready' 等于永不摘流量（本契约建立前 admin-api 正是这个形态，DB/Redis 全挂也报 200）。"
    },
    "payloadRules": [
      "payload.status 必须是 statusValues 之一；旧值 'unready' 已废弃",
      "not_ready 时 payload.reason 必须是非空字符串（运维要能直接看出为什么）",
      "ready 时 payload 至少含 status",
      "各端按自身信封约定嵌套 payload，嵌套位置见 perComponent[*].bodyPath；不得在 payload 外再包一层自定义键（如 python 旧实现经 HTTPException 包成的 'detail'）"
    ],
    "vectors": [
      {
        "name": "ready",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "payload": { "status": "ready" }
      },
      {
        "name": "notReady",
        "httpStatus": 503,
        "payload": { "status": "not_ready", "reason": "admin-api unreachable" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "timeout": {
    "$comment": "任务超时（秒）的解析语义。E-02（python）/ 改动4（node）已各自实现，此处把它钉成三方共有的向量，防止后续任一侧回退成 '0 → 用默认值' 或 '0 → 立即超时' 的旧语义。",
    "unbounded": 0,
    "min": 1,
    "max": 86400,
    "vectors": [
      {
        "name": "zero-is-unbounded",
        "declared": 0,
        "unbounded": true,
        "$comment": "0 = 显式不限时（admin task 实体默认就是 0）。绝不能当成 falsy 回退到执行器默认值，也不能当成 0ms 立即超时。"
      },
      {
        "name": "min-bound",
        "declared": 1,
        "unbounded": false
      },
      {
        "name": "max-bound",
        "declared": 86400,
        "unbounded": false
      },
      {
        "name": "above-max-rejected-at-admin",
        "declared": 86401,
        "rejectedBy": "admin-api, executor-node, executor-python",
        "$comment": "admin 侧 create-task.dto 已用 @Min(0) @Max(86400) 前置拦截，正常派发路径执行器收不到越界值。执行器侧纵深防御：executor-node 一直拒绝 400；executor-python 此前 clamp 到边界（两端不一致，曾如实登记为已知漂移），A3-C 把协议 schemas.TaskConfig 接进两侧 accept 路径后改为同步拒绝 400——两端策略收敛。_clamp_timeout_seconds 仍保留为解析期兜底（越界值在到达执行等待前不可能出现，但多一层不依赖调用方）。"
      },
      {
        "name": "negative-rejected-at-admin",
        "declared": -1,
        "rejectedBy": "admin-api, executor-node, executor-python",
        "$comment": "同上：admin 侧 @Min(0) 拦截；A3-C 起执行器侧两端一致拒绝（此前 python clamp 到 1）。"
      },
      {
        "name": "missing-falls-back-to-executor-default",
        "declared": null,
        "unbounded": false,
        "usesExecutorDefault": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "failureReason": {
    "$comment": "失败原因枚举。全集以 admin 的 ExecutionFailureReason 为准；其中 adminInternalOnly 的取值由 admin 内部（stale sweep 等）写入，**执行器不得上报**——本契约建立前 admin 的 @IsIn 用的是全集，等于允许执行器上报一个语义上只有 admin 才该写的取值；python 侧则完全没有枚举约束，只靠字符串字面量。",
    "all": [
      "package_fetch_failed",
      "script_error",
      "timeout",
      "executor_offline",
      "executor_restart",
      "stale_recovered",
      "dependency_install_failed",
      "git_fetch_failed",
      "runtime_missing",
      "killed",
      "unknown"
    ],
    "adminInternalOnly": ["stale_recovered"],
    "executorReportable": [
      "package_fetch_failed",
      "script_error",
      "timeout",
      "executor_offline",
      "executor_restart",
      "dependency_install_failed",
      "git_fetch_failed",
      "runtime_missing",
      "killed",
      "unknown"
    ]
  },
  "schemas": {
    "$comment": "A3 完整形态：执行器协议的 **schema 单一事实源**（JSON Schema 2020-12 受控子集）。由 scripts/generate-executor-protocol.mjs 生成 executor-node 的 zod 与 executor-python 的 pydantic。此前 ExecuteRequest 在 node 是手写 TS interface、在 python 是 autocodeflow_sdk 里的 pydantic model、在 admin 是拼接的字面量——三处各自演进，只靠注释互相引用（'见 node execute.ts:xxx parity'），即评审说的『注释里的 parity』。**受控子集**：type（数组形式即 nullable）/ properties / required / additionalProperties / items / enum / minimum / maximum / pattern / default / $ref（仅限 '#/$defs/<本段内的名字>'）。生成器遇到子集外的关键字必须**报错退出**——静默跳过会让契约悄悄失效（本项目第三次遇到此类陷阱）。",
    "TaskConfig": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "name": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "runtime": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "entrypoint": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "timeout": {
          "type": ["integer", "null"],
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 86400,
          "description": "deprecated：legacy/fallback 字段，规范化后与 timeoutSeconds 同值。边界与 timeoutSeconds 同（0 = 显式不限时，其余 1..86400）——A3-C 之前本字段**无边界**，而 executor-node 实际一直按 0 或 1..86400 拒绝、executor-python 静默 clamp，协议与实现不符；补边界后协议才真正描述执行器行为（见本文件 timeout 段）。"
        },
        "timeoutSeconds": {
          "type": ["integer", "null"],
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 86400,
          "description": "canonical 超时（秒）；0 = 显式不限时，语义见本文件 timeout 段"
        },
        "timeout_seconds": {
          "type": ["integer", "null"],
          "description": "deprecated：snake_case 别名"
        },
        "requirements": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": { "type": "string" },
          "default": []
        },
        "gitRepo": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "gitBranch": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
        "gitCommit": { "type": ["string", "null"] }
      }
    },
    "ExecuteRequest": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "required": ["executionId", "task"],
      "properties": {
        "executionId": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}$",
          "description": "同时被用作 workDir 下的目录名——字符集限定是路径穿越的第一道闸（与 node isSafeExecutionIdSegment 同款正则）"
        },
        "task": { "$ref": "#/$defs/TaskConfig" },
        "params": { "type": ["object", "null"], "additionalProperties": true }
      }
    },
    "ConfigReloadRequest": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "properties": {
        "maxConcurrentTasks": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "taskTimeoutSeconds": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "heartbeatIntervalSeconds": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 5 },
        "adminApiUrl": { "type": "string" },
        "adminApiUrlInternal": { "type": "string" },
        "adminApiUrlExternal": { "type": "string" },
        "adminApiUrls": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "workDir": { "type": "string" },
        "WORK_DIR": { "type": "string" }
      }
    },
    "ConfigReloadResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "required": ["success", "message", "updated_fields", "ignored_fields"],
      "properties": {
        "success": { "type": "boolean" },
        "message": { "type": "string" },
        "updated_fields": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "ignored_fields": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    },
    "HealthReadyResponse": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "required": ["status"],
      "properties": {
        "status": { "enum": ["ready", "not_ready"] },
        "reason": { "type": "string" }
      }
    }
  },
  "schemaVectors": {
    "$comment": "每个 schema 的合法/非法样本，三端加载**同一份**断言。invalid 除 payload 外必须给出 expectErrorPath——只断言『被拒绝』而不断言『为什么被拒绝』会退化成永真断言（任一字段拼错都会红，那就谁都能红）。path 为数组，zod 的 issue.path 与 pydantic 的 error.loc 同形。",
    "TaskConfig": {
      "valid": [{}, { "runtime": "python", "timeoutSeconds": 0 }],
      "invalid": [
        {
          "name": "timeoutSeconds-below-min",
          "payload": { "timeoutSeconds": -1 },
          "expectErrorPath": ["timeoutSeconds"]
        },
        {
          "name": "requirements-item-not-string",
          "payload": { "requirements": [1] },
          "expectErrorPath": ["requirements", 0]
        }
      ]
    },
    "ExecuteRequest": {
      "valid": [
        { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": { "runtime": "python" } },
        {
          "executionId": "exec-2",
          "task": {
            "id": "t1",
            "name": "job",
            "runtime": "python",
            "entrypoint": "main.py",
            "timeoutSeconds": 0,
            "requirements": ["requests==2.31.0"],
            "gitRepo": "https://example.com/a.git",
            "gitCommit": "abc123",
            "gitBranch": "main"
          },
          "params": { "foo": 1 }
        },
        {
          "executionId": "exec-3",
          "task": { "runtime": "node", "someFutureField": 42 },
          "unknownTopLevel": { "a": 1 }
        }
      ],
      "invalid": [
        {
          "name": "missing-executionId",
          "payload": { "task": { "runtime": "python" } },
          "expectErrorPath": ["executionId"]
        },
        {
          "name": "missing-task",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1" },
          "expectErrorPath": ["task"]
        },
        {
          "name": "executionId-not-string",
          "payload": { "executionId": 123, "task": {} },
          "expectErrorPath": ["executionId"]
        },
        {
          "name": "executionId-path-traversal",
          "payload": { "executionId": "../etc/passwd", "task": {} },
          "expectErrorPath": ["executionId"]
        },
        {
          "name": "task-not-object",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": "nope" },
          "expectErrorPath": ["task"]
        },
        {
          "name": "task-timeoutSeconds-above-max",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": { "timeoutSeconds": 86401 } },
          "expectErrorPath": ["task", "timeoutSeconds"]
        },
        {
          "name": "task-timeout-above-max",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": { "timeout": 86401 } },
          "expectErrorPath": ["task", "timeout"],
          "$comment": "A3-C 补边界前本用例不会红——协议说 timeout 无界，而 executor-node 早就按 0 或 1..86400 拒绝、executor-python 静默 clamp。「协议没写」不等于「实现没做」，这正是把 schema 接进运行时才暴露出来的那类漂移。"
        },
        {
          "name": "params-not-object",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": {}, "params": "nope" },
          "expectErrorPath": ["params"]
        },
        {
          "name": "task-requirements-not-array",
          "payload": { "executionId": "exec-1", "task": { "requirements": "lodash" } },
          "expectErrorPath": ["task", "requirements"],
          "$comment": "E-19：两侧执行器各有一份手检（『requirements must be an array of package names』）。协议补上同一约束后，即使有人删掉手检，schema 闸门仍会拦住——契约不再依赖某个具体实现记得写 if。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ConfigReloadRequest": {
      "valid": [
        {},
        { "maxConcurrentTasks": 4 },
        { "workDir": "/tmp/x", "adminApiUrls": ["http://a"] }
      ],
      "invalid": [
        {
          "name": "maxConcurrentTasks-below-1",
          "payload": { "maxConcurrentTasks": 0 },
          "expectErrorPath": ["maxConcurrentTasks"]
        },
        {
          "name": "heartbeatIntervalSeconds-below-5",
          "payload": { "heartbeatIntervalSeconds": 1 },
          "expectErrorPath": ["heartbeatIntervalSeconds"]
        },
        {
          "name": "adminApiUrls-not-array",
          "payload": { "adminApiUrls": "nope" },
          "expectErrorPath": ["adminApiUrls"]
        }
      ]
    },
    "ConfigReloadResponse": {
      "valid": [
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "ok",
          "updated_fields": ["workDir"],
          "ignored_fields": []
        }
      ],
      "invalid": [
        {
          "name": "missing-ignored_fields",
          "payload": {
            "success": true,
            "message": "ok",
            "updated_fields": []
          },
          "expectErrorPath": ["ignored_fields"]
        }
      ]
    },
    "HealthReadyResponse": {
      "valid": [
        { "status": "ready" },
        { "status": "not_ready", "reason": "admin-api unreachable" }
      ],
      "invalid": [
        {
          "name": "deprecated-status-unready",
          "payload": { "status": "unready" },
          "expectErrorPath": ["status"]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
